00:027:13.000 --> 00:027:21.000
Now, we see throughout the Quran. I don’t need to go through these verses with you. But we see guarantees of victory for the believers

00:027:21.000 --> 00:027:31.000
and for the messengers, God's messengers. And especially, in the last SURA of the Quran, last SURA revealed chronologically.

00:027:31.000 --> 00:027:37.000
which says when God's victory comes and you the people embracing God's religion in great numbers.

00:027:37.000 --> 00:027:47.000
This SURA consists of 19 words. And the first verse consists of 19 letters which means what? Means this is intended for us.

00:027:47.000 --> 00:027:56.000
And from all signs that this message of worshiping God alone, people are receptive everywhere in the world, all over the world.

00:027:56.000 --> 00:028:04.000
There are so many people. I'm really surprised how receptive people are. And you can see the sincerity in their writings, their letters

00:028:04.000 --> 00:028:17.000
their telephone calls, in their behavior. I mean, I don’t think it ever happened before in history that in the lifetime of the messenger

00:028:17.000 --> 00:028:25.000
he delivered the message to this... this many people. Certainly, never. I mean, the message, this message, worshiping God alone

00:028:25.000 --> 00:028:33.000
upholding the Quran alone has been delivered to more people than the people that Noah, Abraham, Moses, Jesus and Zachariah

00:028:33.000 --> 00:028:41.000
and John and all these people delivered in their lifetime combined multiplied many times over. I'm talking about just the delivery

00:028:41.000 --> 00:028:49.000
of the message. But the people who believed are overwhelmingly even more. You know how many people were with Jesus when

00:028:49.000 --> 00:028:54.000
he... when he finished... when he completed his message. He had a dozen of people... a dozen people.

00:028:54.000 --> 00:029:02.000
And you see in our conference, we have hundreds of people. ALHAMDULILLAH. And this last conference were 150 people

00:029:02.000 --> 00:029:11.000
approximately. And these are sincere believers. I mean, I screened them. There may be two or three exceptions there.

00:029:11.000 --> 00:029:20.000
But these are really people who believed in worshiping God alone, devoting their worship to God alone. They corrected their practices.

00:029:20.000 --> 00:029:29.000
And they uphold the Quran alone. So, this is really victory. And we should be thankful to God that...

00:029:29.000 --> 00:029:39.000
that it is not any more popular than this. I don’t know how to put this but because we'll have... we will have no time to do anything else

00:029:39.000 --> 00:029:47.000
but as it is, we have time now to get the translation out, to get the principles out, to get the information out.

00:029:47.000 --> 00:029:57.000
And we don’t need any secret service or crowds out in the street or anything like that.

00:029:58.000 --> 00:030:03.000
I believe that every messenger's really for the future generations not for his generation.

00:030:04.000 --> 00:030:14.000
But all these people who are... this is very pleasing to our hearts to see so many people now believing and worshiping God alone.

00:030:14.000 --> 00:030:22.000
And this is the criterion that tells you that you are right. Because the Quran said that every party is happy and pleased

00:030:22.000 --> 00:030:32.000
with what they. And we have to... to... to examine ourselves as to are we right or wrong? Are we fooling ourselves?

00:030:33.000 --> 00:030:36.000
So, your criterion is with your worshiping God alone, upholding the Quran alone.

00:030:36.000 --> 00:030:37.000
AQEM AL-SALAT

00:030:37.000 --> 00:030:39.000
ALLAH-O AKBAR. ALLAH-O AKBAR.

